{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13363","headline":"喜陆侍御破石埭草寇东峰亭赋诗 · 郭澹","name":"喜陆侍御破石埭草寇东峰亭赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"介胄鹰扬出，山林蚁聚空。\n忽闻飞简报，曾是坐筹功。\n逈夜昏氛灭，危亭眺望雄。\n茂勳推世上，余兴寄杯中。\n喜色烟霞改，欢忻里巷同。\n幸兹尊俎末，饮至又从公。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭澹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13363.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13363","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}